  "title": "The Answer You Never Chose",
  "total_seconds": 664.95,
  "total_mmss": "11:04",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "scene": 0,
      "tone": "intro",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/chose/v2/00.wav",
      "start": 0.0,
      "dur": 62.26,
      "speech_start": 3.0,
      "speech_end": 61.56,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "Welcome to Truthward.",
          "start": 3.0,
          "dur": 1.332,
          "abs_start": 3.0
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "Good to have you here.",
          "start": 4.332,
          "dur": 1.332,
          "abs_start": 4.332
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "Here is the whole idea behind this channel.",
          "start": 5.664,
          "dur": 2.686,
          "abs_start": 5.664
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "In every video, we take one real question, and we do our honest best to answer it.",
          "start": 8.85,
          "dur": 4.848,
          "abs_start": 8.85
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "We reason it through, step by step, and we look at it honestly, without preaching and without telling you what to think.",
          "start": 13.698,
          "dur": 6.122,
          "abs_start": 13.698
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "And by the end, we will usually have more than an answer.",
          "start": 20.32,
          "dur": 5.0,
          "abs_start": 20.32
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "We will have a new question or two worth chasing, and those become the next videos.",
          "start": 25.32,
          "dur": 6.516,
          "abs_start": 25.32
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "That is really all this is.",
          "start": 31.836,
          "dur": 2.394,
          "abs_start": 31.836
        },
        {
          "i": 8,
          "text": "Because the truth is never as complicated as people make it sound.",
          "start": 34.73,
          "dur": 3.468,
          "abs_start": 34.73
        },
        {
          "i": 9,
          "text": "It is honest, and simple enough for anyone to follow.",
          "start": 38.198,
          "dur": 3.003,
          "abs_start": 38.198
        },
        {
          "i": 10,
          "text": "So all we try to do here is bring it back to the surface, one question at a time.",
          "start": 41.201,
          "dur": 4.359,
          "abs_start": 41.201
        },
        {
          "i": 11,
          "text": "If you want to come along for that, subscribe so the next question finds you.",
          "start": 46.06,
          "dur": 5.207,
          "abs_start": 46.06
        },
        {
          "i": 12,
          "text": "Leave a comment, especially if you see it differently.",
          "start": 51.267,
          "dur": 4.673,
          "abs_start": 51.267
        },
        {
          "i": 13,
          "text": "And if it was worth your time, a like helps.",
          "start": 55.939,
          "dur": 3.071,
          "abs_start": 55.939
        },
        {
          "i": 14,
          "text": "Alright.",
          "start": 59.51,
          "dur": 0.762,
          "abs_start": 59.51
        },
        {
          "i": 15,
          "text": "Let us begin.",
          "start": 60.272,
          "dur": 1.288,
          "abs_start": 60.272
        }
      ],
      "beats": [
        {
          "start": 3.0,
          "dur": 58.56,
          "label": "intro (merk)",
          "img": "",
          "vid": ""
        }
      ],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 1,
      "tone": "rustig",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/chose/v2/01.wav",
      "start": 62.26,
      "dur": 44.77,
      "speech_start": 0.0,
      "speech_end": 44.22,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "Let me show you something you do all day long and never once notice.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "dur": 4.657,
          "abs_start": 62.26
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "You think.",
          "start": 4.657,
          "dur": 0.715,
          "abs_start": 66.917
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "From the moment you wake up, you are making decisions.",
          "start": 5.371,
          "dur": 3.819,
          "abs_start": 67.631
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "You look outside, and you decide what to wear.",
          "start": 9.69,
          "dur": 3.872,
          "abs_start": 71.95
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "You decide what to eat, and which way to take to work.",
          "start": 13.562,
          "dur": 4.492,
          "abs_start": 75.822
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "You decide whether to cross the road now or wait for that car to pass.",
          "start": 18.055,
          "dur": 5.545,
          "abs_start": 80.315
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "You decide what to say to someone, and what to keep to yourself.",
          "start": 24.1,
          "dur": 3.682,
          "abs_start": 86.36
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "None of it feels like anything.",
          "start": 27.782,
          "dur": 1.872,
          "abs_start": 90.042
        },
        {
          "i": 8,
          "text": "But every single one of those is your brain doing the same quiet thing.",
          "start": 29.654,
          "dur": 3.556,
          "abs_start": 91.914
        },
        {
          "i": 9,
          "text": "Reading the situation, weighing it, and making a call.",
          "start": 33.71,
          "dur": 4.384,
          "abs_start": 95.97
        },
        {
          "i": 10,
          "text": "You do it hundreds of times a day, and you never once stop to give it a name.",
          "start": 38.094,
          "dur": 6.126,
          "abs_start": 100.354
        }
      ],
      "beats": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "dur": 9.69,
          "label": "wakker, naar buiten",
