      ],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 2,
      "tone": "rustig",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/chose/v2/02.wav",
      "start": 107.03,
      "dur": 45.92,
      "speech_start": 0.0,
      "speech_end": 45.37,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "Now here is what makes that so strange.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "dur": 2.921,
          "abs_start": 107.03
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "Think about an animal for a moment.",
          "start": 2.921,
          "dur": 3.512,
          "abs_start": 109.951
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "A bird getting ready to fly south does not sit there weighing its options.",
          "start": 6.433,
          "dur": 5.577,
          "abs_start": 113.463
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "It does not wonder whether it is making the right call.",
          "start": 12.51,
          "dur": 3.569,
          "abs_start": 119.54
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "It just goes, the way it always has.",
          "start": 16.079,
          "dur": 2.515,
          "abs_start": 123.109
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "That is instinct, not a decision.",
          "start": 18.595,
          "dur": 2.515,
          "abs_start": 125.625
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "You are different.",
          "start": 21.61,
          "dur": 1.239,
          "abs_start": 128.64
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "You can stop before you act.",
          "start": 22.849,
          "dur": 1.658,
          "abs_start": 129.879
        },
        {
          "i": 8,
          "text": "You can question what you are doing, and even question the way you are thinking about it.",
          "start": 24.507,
          "dur": 4.933,
          "abs_start": 131.537
        },
        {
          "i": 9,
          "text": "You can reason about things that are not in front of you at all, things you cannot see or touch.",
          "start": 29.94,
          "dur": 5.034,
          "abs_start": 136.97
        },
        {
          "i": 10,
          "text": "You do this constantly, without ever noticing.",
          "start": 34.974,
          "dur": 2.979,
          "abs_start": 142.004
        },
        {
          "i": 11,
          "text": "And it is exactly this ability, the one you lean on all day without a second thought, that the rest of this video is about.",
          "start": 37.953,
          "dur": 7.417,
          "abs_start": 144.983
        }
      ],
      "beats": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "dur": 16.079,
          "label": "vogels, instinct",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/chose/s02b1__c1.mp4"
        },
        {
          "start": 16.079,
          "dur": 8.428,
          "label": "de mens pauzeert",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/chose/s02b2__c1.mp4"
        },
        {
          "start": 24.507,
          "dur": 20.863,
          "label": "redeneren over het ongeziene",
          "img": "",
          "vid": ""
        }
      ],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 3,
      "tone": "nadruk",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/chose/v2/03.wav",
      "start": 152.95,
      "dur": 44.94,
      "speech_start": 0.0,
      "speech_end": 44.14,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "And watch what you do when something actually matters.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "dur": 4.49,
          "abs_start": 152.95
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "You do not get more reckless.",
          "start": 4.49,
          "dur": 2.381,
          "abs_start": 157.44
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "You get more careful.",
          "start": 6.871,
          "dur": 2.079,
          "abs_start": 159.821
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "Say something goes wrong with your car, something you do not understand.",
          "start": 9.45,
          "dur": 5.627,
          "abs_start": 162.4
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "You do not open the hood and start pulling at wires and hope for the best.",
          "start": 15.077,
          "dur": 5.743,
          "abs_start": 168.027
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "You take it to someone who actually knows engines.",
          "start": 20.82,
          "dur": 4.3,
          "abs_start": 173.77
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "And think about what really happens in that moment.",
          "start": 25.62,
          "dur": 2.68,
          "abs_start": 178.57
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "You looked at the situation, you saw the edge of what you know, and you decided to go to someone who knows more.",
          "start": 28.3,
          "dur": 5.996,
          "abs_start": 181.25
        },
        {
          "i": 8,
          "text": "That is not you being lazy or giving up.",
          "start": 34.296,
          "dur": 2.294,
          "abs_start": 187.246
        },
        {
          "i": 9,
          "text": "That is your mind working exactly the way it should.",
          "start": 37.09,
          "dur": 2.899,
          "abs_start": 190.04
        },
        {
          "i": 10,
          "text": "Knowing what you do not know is one of the smartest things a person can do.",
          "start": 39.989,
          "dur": 4.151,
          "abs_start": 192.939
        }
      ],
      "beats": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "dur": 15.077,
          "label": "de auto hapert",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/chose/s03b1__c1.mp4"
        },
        {
          "start": 15.077,
          "dur": 19.219,
          "label": "de monteur die het weet",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/chose/s03b2__c1.mp4"
        },
        {
          "start": 34.296,
          "dur": 9.844,
          "label": "weten wat je niet weet",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/chose/s03b3__c1.mp4"
        }
      ],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 4,
      "tone": "rustig",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/chose/v2/04.wav",
      "start": 197.89,
      "dur": 41.62,
      "speech_start": 0.0,
      "speech_end": 41.07,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "And you want a reason before you believe something, especially when it counts.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "dur": 5.809,
          "abs_start": 197.89
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "A stranger walks up and tells you to hand over your savings, and no matter how friendly he is, something in you says, wait, prove it first.",
          "start": 5.809,
          "dur": 9.631,
          "abs_start": 203.699
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "A doctor gives you a pill, and it is fair to ask what it is and what it does before you swallow it.",
          "start": 15.94,
          "dur": 6.863,
          "abs_start": 213.83
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "You do this without even thinking about it.",
          "start": 22.803,
          "dur": 3.106,
          "abs_start": 220.693
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "You do not just accept things because someone said them with confidence.",
          "start": 25.91,
          "dur": 4.31,
          "abs_start": 223.8
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "You look first, and you decide after.",
          "start": 30.72,
          "dur": 2.332,
          "abs_start": 228.61
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "And deep down you know that simply taking something on someone else's word, and never once checking it, would be a foolish way to live.",
          "start": 33.052,
          "dur": 8.018,
          "abs_start": 230.942
        }
      ],
      "beats": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "dur": 22.803,
          "label": "de vreemde, je geld",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/chose/s04b1__c1.mp4"
        },
        {
          "start": 22.803,
          "dur": 18.267,
          "label": "de dokter, de pil",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/chose/s04b2__c1.mp4"
        }
      ],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 5,
      "tone": "nadruk",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/chose/v2/05.wav",
      "start": 239.51,
      "dur": 27.58,
      "speech_start": 0.0,
      "speech_end": 26.78,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "So here is the strange part.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "dur": 1.719,
          "abs_start": 239.51
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "With all of that, there is one question where every bit of it just switches off.",
          "start": 1.719,
          "dur": 5.357,
          "abs_start": 241.229
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "One place where the careful, reasoning, show-me-first version of you simply does not show up.",
          "start": 7.076,
          "dur": 6.254,
          "abs_start": 246.586
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "And it is not some small thing tucked away in a corner of your life.",
          "start": 13.83,
          "dur": 4.086,
          "abs_start": 253.34
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "It is the biggest question there is.",
          "start": 17.916,
          "dur": 2.14,
          "abs_start": 257.426
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "Bigger than your health, bigger than your money, bigger than anything you would ever think twice about anywhere else.",
          "start": 20.056,
          "dur": 6.724,
          "abs_start": 259.566
        }
      ],
      "beats": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "dur": 13.83,
          "label": "het schakelt uit",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/chose/s05b1__c1.mp4"
        },
        {
          "start": 13.83,
          "dur": 12.95,
          "label": "de grootste vraag",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/chose/s05b2__c1.mp4"
        }
      ],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 6,
      "tone": "nadruk",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/chose/v2/06.wav",
      "start": 267.09,
      "dur": 35.05,
      "speech_start": 0.0,
      "speech_end": 34.25,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "Here it is.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "dur": 0.796,
          "abs_start": 267.09
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "Why are you here.",
          "start": 0.796,
          "dur": 1.0,
          "abs_start": 267.886
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "What is all of this, really.",
          "start": 1.796,
          "dur": 1.734,
          "abs_start": 268.886
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "And what happens when it is over.",
          "start": 4.03,
          "dur": 1.972,
          "abs_start": 271.12
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "Do not rush past those.",
          "start": 6.002,
          "dur": 1.175,
          "abs_start": 273.092
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "Sit in them for a second, because every other thing you do is quietly built on top of the answer you gave them.",
          "start": 7.177,
          "dur": 6.273,
          "abs_start": 274.267
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "And on this one, the biggest of them all, most people never actually stopped to think.",
          "start": 13.95,
          "dur": 6.462,
          "abs_start": 281.04
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "Not once.",
          "start": 20.412,
          "dur": 0.811,
          "abs_start": 287.502
        },
        {
          "i": 8,
          "text": "They did not look at it the way they look at everything else.",
          "start": 21.223,
          "dur": 4.727,
          "abs_start": 288.313
        },
        {
          "i": 9,
          "text": "They just carry an answer around.",
          "start": 26.45,
          "dur": 2.369,
          "abs_start": 293.54
        },
        {
          "i": 10,
          "text": "And if you ask them, gently, where that answer came from, the room usually goes quiet.",
          "start": 28.819,
          "dur": 5.431,
          "abs_start": 295.909
        }
      ],
      "beats": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "dur": 6.002,
          "label": "kosmos, waarom hier",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/chose/s06b1__c1.mp4"
        },
        {
          "start": 6.002,
          "dur": 15.221,
          "label": "een kaars in het donker",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/chose/s06b2__c1.mp4"
        },
        {
          "start": 21.223,
          "dur": 13.027,
          "label": "de stille kamer",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/chose/s06b3__c1.mp4"
        }
      ],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 7,
      "tone": "warm",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/chose/v2/07.wav",
      "start": 302.14,
      "dur": 42.33,
      "speech_start": 0.0,
      "speech_end": 41.38,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "And I am not saying this from above anyone.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "dur": 2.604,
          "abs_start": 302.14
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "I am saying it because it was me.",
          "start": 2.604,
          "dur": 2.166,
          "abs_start": 304.744
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "I had my answer too.",
          "start": 4.77,
          "dur": 1.51,
          "abs_start": 306.91
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "I carried it around for years like it was mine, like I had earned it somewhere along the way.",
          "start": 6.78,
          "dur": 6.378,
          "abs_start": 308.92
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "Until one ordinary day I stopped and asked myself one simple thing.",
          "start": 13.158,
          "dur": 4.79,
          "abs_start": 315.298
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "Have I ever actually sat down with this, the single biggest question there is, and looked at it the way I would look at anything else that mattered.",
          "start": 17.948,
          "dur": 9.652,
          "abs_start": 320.088
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "And the honest answer was no.",
          "start": 28.1,
          "dur": 3.169,
          "abs_start": 330.24
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "Not once.",
          "start": 31.269,
          "dur": 1.032,
          "abs_start": 333.409
        },
        {
          "i": 8,
          "text": "It had been handed to me a long time ago, and I had spent my whole life calling it my own.",
          "start": 32.301,
          "dur": 9.079,
          "abs_start": 334.441
        }
      ],
      "beats": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "dur": 13.158,
          "label": "ik betrapte mezelf (raam)",
