    {
      "scene": 9,
      "tone": "nadruk",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/chose/v2/09.wav",
      "start": 413.59,
      "dur": 33.25,
      "speech_start": 0.0,
      "speech_end": 32.45,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "Now look at those five honestly.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "dur": 2.049,
          "abs_start": 413.59
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "Four of them are something coming at you from the outside and settling in.",
          "start": 2.049,
          "dur": 4.581,
          "abs_start": 415.639
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "One of them is you shoving something away.",
          "start": 6.63,
          "dur": 2.97,
          "abs_start": 420.22
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "And not a single one of them is you sitting down and reasoning it through.",
          "start": 10.1,
          "dur": 4.897,
          "abs_start": 423.69
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "And yet, for most people, that is exactly how they came to hold the most important thing they believe.",
          "start": 14.997,
          "dur": 6.762,
          "abs_start": 428.587
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "One person took it in whole and never questioned it.",
          "start": 21.759,
          "dur": 3.861,
          "abs_start": 435.349
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "The next threw it out just as fast.",
          "start": 26.12,
          "dur": 1.772,
          "abs_start": 439.71
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "And both of them walked away completely sure that they had chosen it themselves.",
          "start": 27.892,
          "dur": 4.558,
          "abs_start": 441.482
        }
      ],
      "beats": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "dur": 14.997,
          "label": "vier van buiten",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/chose/s09b1__c1.mp4"
        },
        {
          "start": 14.997,
          "dur": 17.453,
          "label": "eentje duwt weg",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/chose/s09b2__c1.mp4"
        }
      ],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 10,
      "tone": "nadruk",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/chose/v2/10.wav",
      "start": 446.84,
      "dur": 56.57,
      "speech_start": 0.0,
      "speech_end": 55.77,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "Now you might be thinking, fine, I was a kid, of course I did not choose it back then.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "dur": 5.225,
          "abs_start": 446.84
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "But I am grown now.",
          "start": 5.225,
          "dur": 1.358,
          "abs_start": 452.065
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "If it were wrong, I would have gone back and checked.",
          "start": 6.583,
          "dur": 3.107,
          "abs_start": 453.423
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "And here is the uncomfortable part.",
          "start": 10.19,
          "dur": 2.337,
          "abs_start": 457.03
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "Most of us never do.",
          "start": 12.527,
          "dur": 1.629,
          "abs_start": 459.367
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "And it is not because we are not smart enough.",
          "start": 14.155,
          "dur": 3.045,
          "abs_start": 460.995
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "It is that by now the answer is not just something you hold in your head.",
          "start": 17.7,
          "dur": 5.383,
          "abs_start": 464.54
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "It has grown into who you are.",
          "start": 23.083,
          "dur": 2.407,
          "abs_start": 469.923
        },
        {
          "i": 8,
          "text": "It is tangled up with the people you belong to.",
          "start": 25.491,
          "dur": 3.489,
          "abs_start": 472.331
        },
        {
          "i": 9,
          "text": "And when something sits that close to you, you stop testing it and you start protecting it.",
          "start": 29.48,
          "dur": 4.593,
          "abs_start": 476.32
        },
        {
          "i": 10,
          "text": "You take that same sharp mind that picks the right mechanic, and you point it at defending your answer instead of checking it.",
          "start": 34.073,
          "dur": 6.157,
          "abs_start": 480.913
        },
        {
          "i": 11,
          "text": "That is the trap.",
          "start": 40.73,
          "dur": 1.542,
          "abs_start": 487.57
        },
        {
          "i": 12,
          "text": "And the sharper the mind, the better it gets at defending.",
          "start": 42.272,
          "dur": 5.192,
          "abs_start": 489.112
        },
        {
          "i": 13,
          "text": "It is not the careless people who are most stuck here.",
          "start": 47.463,
          "dur": 4.374,
          "abs_start": 494.303
        },
        {
          "i": 14,
          "text": "Very often, it is the smartest ones.",
          "start": 51.837,
          "dur": 3.933,
          "abs_start": 498.677
        }
      ],
      "beats": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "dur": 12.527,
          "label": "volwassen, de spiegel",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/chose/s10b1__c1.mp4"
        },
        {
          "start": 12.527,
