    {
      "scene": 11,
      "tone": "nadruk",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/chose/v2/11.wav",
      "start": 503.41,
      "dur": 56.37,
      "speech_start": 0.0,
      "speech_end": 55.57,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "So.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "dur": 0.424,
          "abs_start": 503.41
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "Why does that reasoning, the thing you do all day without noticing, switch off right here, on the question that matters more than any other?",
          "start": 0.424,
          "dur": 8.192,
          "abs_start": 503.834
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "I promised you an answer, so here it is, plainly.",
          "start": 8.616,
          "dur": 3.594,
          "abs_start": 512.026
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "It is not that people are stupid.",
          "start": 12.71,
          "dur": 1.888,
          "abs_start": 516.12
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "It is that an answer was already sitting there, waiting for them.",
          "start": 14.598,
          "dur": 3.925,
          "abs_start": 518.008
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "Through one of those five doors, it got filled in long before they ever showed up to ask.",
          "start": 18.524,
          "dur": 4.986,
          "abs_start": 521.934
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "There was never a blank page in front of them waiting to be filled.",
          "start": 24.01,
          "dur": 3.716,
          "abs_start": 527.42
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "And the one time they might have gone back to check it, the answer had already become a part of who they are.",
          "start": 27.726,
          "dur": 5.916,
          "abs_start": 531.136
        },
        {
          "i": 8,
          "text": "So they protected it instead.",
          "start": 33.642,
          "dur": 1.848,
          "abs_start": 537.052
        },
        {
          "i": 9,
          "text": "That is the answer.",
          "start": 35.99,
          "dur": 1.364,
          "abs_start": 539.4
        },
        {
          "i": 10,
          "text": "And let me be honest about my own.",
          "start": 37.354,
          "dur": 2.519,
          "abs_start": 540.764
        },
        {
          "i": 11,
          "text": "These are the five doors I could find.",
          "start": 39.873,
          "dur": 2.057,
          "abs_start": 543.283
        },
        {
          "i": 12,
          "text": "Maybe there is a sixth that I missed, and maybe you are the one who finds it.",
          "start": 42.43,
          "dur": 3.779,
          "abs_start": 545.84
        },
        {
          "i": 13,
          "text": "They are not set in stone just because they came out of my head.",
          "start": 46.209,
          "dur": 3.082,
          "abs_start": 549.619
        },
        {
          "i": 14,
          "text": "But look at them honestly, and ask yourself one thing.",
          "start": 49.291,
          "dur": 2.81,
          "abs_start": 552.701
        },
        {
          "i": 15,
          "text": "Is even one of them a real reason to be sure of anything?",
          "start": 52.101,
          "dur": 3.469,
          "abs_start": 555.511
        }
      ],
      "beats": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "dur": 18.524,
          "label": "het antwoord lag klaar",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/chose/s11b1__c1.mp4"
        },
        {
          "start": 18.524,
          "dur": 17.466,
          "label": "nooit een leeg vel",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/chose/s11b2__c1.mp4"
        },
        {
          "start": 35.99,
          "dur": 10.219,
          "label": "je beschermt het",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/chose/s11b3__c1.mp4"
        },
        {
          "start": 46.209,
