    {
      "scene": 12,
      "tone": "warm",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/chose/v2/12.wav",
      "start": 559.78,
      "dur": 72.42,
      "speech_start": 0.0,
      "speech_end": 71.47,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "And this is where it starts to itch.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "dur": 1.85,
          "abs_start": 559.78
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "If your answer to the biggest question of all did not really come from you, but from where you happened to be born, and who raised you, and what once hurt you, then how could you ever actually know whether it is true?",
          "start": 1.85,
          "dur": 11.91,
          "abs_start": 561.63
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "Most people never even get to that question.",
          "start": 14.26,
          "dur": 2.747,
          "abs_start": 574.04
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "But most is not all.",
          "start": 17.007,
          "dur": 1.362,
          "abs_start": 576.787
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "Some people do go back.",
          "start": 18.368,
          "dur": 1.362,
          "abs_start": 578.148
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "Some do sit down and look.",
          "start": 20.23,
          "dur": 1.411,
          "abs_start": 580.01
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "That is the only reason anyone, ever, has changed their mind about anything.",
          "start": 21.641,
          "dur": 4.725,
          "abs_start": 581.421
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "So maybe you are one of the ones who looks.",
          "start": 26.366,
          "dur": 2.434,
          "abs_start": 586.146
        },
        {
          "i": 8,
          "text": "This time.",
          "start": 29.3,
          "dur": 0.913,
          "abs_start": 589.08
        },
        {
          "i": 9,
          "text": "And the second you try, something steps in the way.",
          "start": 30.213,
          "dur": 4.567,
          "abs_start": 589.993
        },
        {
          "i": 10,
          "text": "A quiet voice that says, who cares, it is all just opinion anyway.",
          "start": 34.78,
          "dur": 6.33,
          "abs_start": 594.56
        },
        {
          "i": 11,
          "text": "Your truth, my truth, nobody is really right.",
          "start": 41.61,
          "dur": 2.888,
          "abs_start": 601.39
        },
        {
          "i": 12,
          "text": "And if that were true, then this whole thing is pointless before it even starts.",
          "start": 44.498,
          "dur": 4.3,
          "abs_start": 604.278
        },
        {
          "i": 13,
          "text": "So before we go anywhere near what the answer might be, we have to deal with that one first.",
          "start": 48.798,
          "dur": 5.402,
          "abs_start": 608.578
        },
        {
          "i": 14,
          "text": "Is there such a thing as a truth that stays true whether you believe it or not?",
          "start": 54.7,
          "dur": 5.118,
          "abs_start": 614.48
        },
        {
          "i": 15,
          "text": "Or is all of it just opinion?",
          "start": 59.818,
          "dur": 2.546,
          "abs_start": 619.598
        },
        {
          "i": 16,
          "text": "Until we have looked at that honestly, nothing else we say has any ground to stand on.",
          "start": 62.365,
          "dur": 6.302,
          "abs_start": 622.145
        },
        {
          "i": 17,
          "text": "And that is exactly where we go next.",
          "start": 68.666,
          "dur": 2.804,
          "abs_start": 628.446
        }
      ],
      "beats": [
        {
          "start": 0.0,
          "dur": 20.23,
